  "prompt": "List the stores with the flagships first. type_rank is the number 1 when store_type is 'flagship', 2 when it is 'standard', 3 when it is 'outlet', and 4 for every other store type. Use the stores table. Return three columns, in this order: store_code, store_type and type_rank. Return one row per store, sorted by type_rank from low to high, then by store_code from A to Z.",
